渔夫还珠 — shadow-puppet style sample (18.0 s, 1920×1080, 24 fps)

Story, puppets, scenery, carving patterns, staging, camera, score and sound design: original, generated by code
in this folder. The "fisherman returns the pearl" tale is an original story; traditional motifs (conical hat,
cloud scrolls, fish-scale openwork, coin and lattice holes, flaming pearl, wave crests) are used generically;
no historical puppet, melody or recording is copied.

Engine: carve.js and gl.js adapted from the shadow-puppet engine of the local film-style library
(LIB=@@LEMO_ROOT@@, styles/shadow-puppet/demo); gl.js extended with a per-lamp hotspot size.
Helpers: $LIB/core (lib.js, render tools, sampler.py, pluck.py, sfx.py) — not modified.

Music samples (CC0 1.0, no attribution required; credited with thanks):
  Samples (CC0): Karoryfer Samples / sfzinstruments (erhu, "aliexpress-erhu"),
  VS Chamber Orchestra: Community Edition (Versilian Studios / Sam Gossner) (crash, sus. cymbal, bass drum,
  log drum, oboe), Versilian Community Sample Library (Versilian Studios) (gong 2, woodblock, claves, clash,
  frame drum, hand chimes, glockenspiel, Nepalese bells).
  https://github.com/sfzinstruments · https://github.com/sgossner/VSCO-2-CE · https://github.com/sgossner/VCSL
Plucked sanxian-like part: physical model (core/audio/pluck.py, shamisen preset), pure synthesis.
Sound effects: synthesized procedurally (numpy/scipy, core/audio/sfx.py and mix.py).

Font: Noto Serif SC 900 (Google Fonts), SIL Open Font License 1.1,
  subset to the 4 glyphs 渔夫还珠 via https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@900&text=渔夫还珠
  (file: fonts/notoserifsc-900-sub.woff2). https://fonts.google.com/noto/specimen/Noto+Serif+SC

No third-party images, footage or recordings of real works are used. No narration, no subtitles.
